Also WRT noi/poi, keep in mind where you put it in relation to the
fa'orma'o. {pa lo ci gerku poi bajra ku'o ku} means "one of (three dogs
which run)" whereas {pa lo ci gerku ku poi bajra ku'o} means "one (of
three dogs) which runs". In ex1 all three dogs run, and in ex2, one dog
runs (perhaps the others do as well, but that's not important).

